    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Introduction</strong><br>What does it feel like to control four ants at once?<br><strong>Worker Ant Simulator</strong> is a physics-based puzzle game where you guide ants to carry food back to their nest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recommended for:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who want to improve their multitasking skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of physics-based puzzle games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players seeking a unique experience as if their consciousness is split into four</p></li></ul>",
